{"version":"2026.10.11-r25","id":"Q408998","formula":"C₅Cl₆","hill":"C5Cl6","elements":["C","Cl"],"composition":{"C":5.0,"Cl":6.0},"names":{"en":"Hexachlorocyclopentadiene","ru":"Гексахлороциклопентадиен"},"descriptions":{"en":"Hexachlorocyclopentadiene (HCCPD), also known as C-56, Graphlox, and HRS 1655, is an organochlorine compound with the formula C5Cl6. It is a precursor to pesticides, flame retardants, and dyes. It is a colourless liquid, although commercial samples appear lemon-yellow liquid sometimes with a bluish vapour.","ru":"Гексахлороциклопентадиен — хлорорганическое соединение с химической формулой C5Cl6. Он является предшественником пестицидов, антипиренов и красителей. Это бесцветная жидкость, хотя коммерческие образцы имеют лимонно-желтый цвет, иногда с голубоватым оттенком."},"fame":15,"pubchemCid":6478,"mass":272.8,"charge":0,"smiles":"C1(=C(C(C(=C1Cl)Cl)(Cl)Cl)Cl)Cl","inchikey":"VUNCWTMEJYMOOR-UHFFFAOYSA-N","iupac":"1,2,3,4,5,5-hexachlorocyclopenta-1,3-diene","classes":[{"qid":"Q113145171","names":{"en":"type of chemical entity","ru":"тип химического объекта","uk":"тип хімічної сутності"}}],"structureInfo":{"kind":"molecule","source":"pubchem","ref":"6478","atoms":11,"license":"PubChem (NIH), public data"},"structure":{"kind":"molecule","atoms":[{"x":2.138,"y":0.001,"z":1.466,"el":"Cl"},{"x":2.138,"y":0.001,"z":-1.467,"el":"Cl"},{"x":0.704,"y":2.782,"z":0.001,"el":"Cl"},{"x":0.705,"y":-2.781,"z":0.001,"el":"Cl"},{"x":-2.497,"y":1.679,"z":0.0,"el":"Cl"},{"x":-2.496,"y":-1.68,"z":0.0,"el":"Cl"},{"x":1.135,"y":0.0,"z":0.0,"el":"C"},{"x":0.176,"y":1.163,"z":0.0,"el":"C"},{"x":0.176,"y":-1.163,"z":0.0,"el":"C"},{"x":-1.09,"y":0.722,"z":0.0,"el":"C"},{"x":-1.09,"y":-0.723,"z":0.0,"el":"C"}],"bonds":[[0,6,1],[1,6,1],[2,7,1],[3,8,1],[4,9,1],[5,10,1],[6,7,1],[6,8,1],[7,9,2],[8,10,2],[9,10,1]]},"sources":[{"role":"identity","name":"Wikidata","url":"https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q408998","license":"CC0 1.0"},{"role":"description","name":"Wikipedia (en)","ur